(()=>{const s={"/products/":'<section id="buyer-brief-guidance" class="section container-site"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Turn your product shortlist into a useful quote</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Record the model, target capacity and estimated quantity for each item you are considering. If you have not chosen a model, describe the shape, intended setting and reference dimensions. Compare the material, lid, straw and included accessories separately: similar photographs do not establish that two configurations have the same specifications.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Group quantities by model, colour or design and explain the intended event, bar service, retail or gift project. For changes to the shape or accessories, include reference images and target dimensions. This helps distinguish an existing configuration from a request that needs further development and sample review.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">For branding, share available artwork, colour references, preferred logo placement and packaging ideas. Confirm the decoration method, usable area and kit contents for the chosen product. Add the destination country, postal code, required arrival date and any split deliveries. Mark undecided requirements clearly; quantities, specifications and delivery arrangements remain subject to the project quotation and sample approval.</p></section>',"/pet-plastic-cups/":'<section id="buyer-brief-guidance" class="section container-site"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Prepare a clear PET cup enquiry</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Record the model, target capacity and estimated quantity for each item you are considering. If you have not chosen a model, describe the shape, intended setting and reference dimensions. Compare the material, lid, straw and included accessories separately: similar photographs do not establish that two configurations have the same specifications.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">For PET cups, describe the drink, intended serving temperature, single or repeated use, and proposed cleaning method. Ask us to review suitability for the selected model. Include any lid or straw reference so compatibility can be checked in the quotation and sample. If documentation is required, identify the destination market, requested document and exact model.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">For branding, share available artwork, colour references, preferred logo placement and packaging ideas. Confirm the decoration method, usable area and kit contents for the chosen product. Add the destination country, postal code, required arrival date and any split deliveries. Mark undecided requirements clearly; quantities, specifications and delivery arrangements remain subject to the project quotation and sample approval.</p></section>',"/zh/products/":'<section id="buyer-brief-guidance" class="section container-site"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">怎样从产品目录整理采购需求</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">先记录你感兴趣的型号、目标容量与数量；尚未确定型号时，可以描述杯型、使用场景和参考尺寸。比较外观相近的产品时，请分别核对材料、尺寸、杯盖、吸管及其他配件，避免把某个型号的配置直接当作整个系列的标准。现有图片可用于初步选型，最终配置应以双方确认的规格和样品为准。</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">按型号、颜色或设计分别提供预计数量，并说明活动、酒吧、零售、礼品或其他实际用途。若需要在现有产品基础上调整形状或配件，请同时提供参考图和目标尺寸，便于区分现有配置选型与需要进一步开发的要求。材料、适用条件及所需文件应按最终选定型号核对。</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">定制 Logo 时，请提供可用图稿、颜色参考、预期位置与包装想法；工艺、印刷范围及套装内容需要结合具体产品确认。交付方面，请列出目的国家、邮编、期望到货日期和是否分批交付。暂时不清楚的条件可以在需求中注明，由双方在报价与样品确认阶段逐项核对；不要把预计数量或期望日期当作已确认的供货承诺。</p></section>',"/zh/pet-plastic-cups/":'<section id="buyer-brief-guidance" class="section container-site"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">准备一份清楚的 PET 杯询价需求</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">先记录你感兴趣的型号、目标容量与数量；尚未确定型号时，可以描述杯型、使用场景和参考尺寸。比较外观相近的产品时，请分别核对材料、尺寸、杯盖、吸管及其他配件，避免把某个型号的配置直接当作整个系列的标准。现有图片可用于初步选型，最终配置应以双方确认的规格和样品为准。</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">说明计划盛装的饮品、使用温度、单次或重复使用安排以及清洁方式，请我们按具体型号核对适用条件。需要杯盖、吸管或其他配件时，提供现有配件或尺寸参考，并在报价和样品中确认匹配情况。若项目要求检测报告，请写明目标市场、所需文件和对应型号，不要仅凭产品名称判断某份文件是否适用。</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">定制 Logo 时，请提供可用图稿、颜色参考、预期位置与包装想法；工艺、印刷范围及套装内容需要结合具体产品确认。交付方面，请列出目的国家、邮编、期望到货日期和是否分批交付。暂时不清楚的条件可以在需求中注明，由双方在报价与样品确认阶段逐项核对；不要把预计数量或期望日期当作已确认的供货承诺。</p></section>'},a=s[location.pathname];if(!a)return;let t=!1;function i(){t=!1;const e=document.querySelector("main");e&&!document.getElementById("buyer-brief-guidance")&&e.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend",a)}i(),new MutationObserver(e=>{t||!e.some(n=>n.addedNodes.length||n.removedNodes.length)||(t=!0,requestAnimationFrame(i))}).observe(document.getElementById("root")||document.body,{childList:!0,subtree:!0})})();
